    "body": "Fixes #8040.\n\nOnly include and initialize coroutine monitoring state when `Profile_config` has emitted its declarations. This lets uninstrumented generator and coroutine modules compile with globally defined `CYTHON_TRACE=1` or `CYTHON_PROFILE=1`, while preserving their shared type layout.\n\nAdds a C/C++ regression covering generators, coroutines and async generators. Checked on Windows with Python 3.12–3.14, the existing profiling/monitoring and generator/async tests, compiler unit tests, and a fresh compiled-wheel install. The installed CLI also passes 16 macro/directive combinations, including enabled monitoring controls. Strict documentation builds report the same four existing diagnostics as master.\n",
